{"3911300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Carrier Wing Ypsilon", "steam_appid": 3911300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4928660], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carrier Wing Ypsilon, is a 3D flight-combat game, where you pilot a variety of futuristic fighter jets to save a distant planet from a space pirate invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911300/extras/a7b49afe76be2e5cc17bc6effd55d5ab.poster.avif?t=1786191799\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911300/extras/a7b49afe76be2e5cc17bc6effd55d5ab.webm?t=1786191799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911300/extras/a7b49afe76be2e5cc17bc6effd55d5ab.mp4?t=1786191799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching story campaign.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a mercenary pilot, who has been hired to fight the invading space pirates. As you progress through the story, you get to choose whose side to take and follow a mission path that will lead you to one of several different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911300/extras/99aeb3aa571b999a507403958e186499.poster.avif?t=1786191799\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911300/extras/99aeb3aa571b999a507403958e186499.webm?t=1786191799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911300/extras/99aeb3aa571b999a507403958e186499.mp4?t=1786191799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plane selection and customization.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple planes to choose from. Install upgrade parts and new weapons to configure your plane for any mission parameters. Save your favorite configurations as presets for later use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911300/extras/a126cc97626bcf9d31443e58a88c0093.poster.avif?t=1786191799\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911300/extras/a126cc97626bcf9d31443e58a88c0093.webm?t=1786191799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911300/extras/a126cc97626bcf9d31443e58a88c0093.mp4?t=1786191799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring character art by Setzeri</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carrier Wing Ypsilon, is a 3D flight-combat game, where you pilot a variety of futuristic fighter jets to save a distant planet from a space pirate invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911300/extras/a7b49afe76be2e5cc17bc6effd55d5ab.poster.avif?t=1786191799\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911300/extras/a7b49afe76be2e5cc17bc6effd55d5ab.webm?t=1786191799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911300/extras/a7b49afe76be2e5cc17bc6effd55d5ab.mp4?t=1786191799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><